 69CR2cL 9/2+ (2020Ne08, QRPA with Skyrme EDF)                                  
 69CR cL $ Measured production cross section=0.025 pb {I+13-14} using {+9}Be    
 69CR2cL target, and 0.42 pb {I+74-31} using W target (e-mail reply of          
 69CR3cL May 22, 2013 from O. Tarasov, first author of 2013Ta14).               
 69CR cL T$ time-of-flight=620-650 ns (considered by the evaluator (B. Singh)   
 69CR2cL to be about the same as in 2009Ta24, which was communicated to the     
 69CR3cL evaluator (B. Singh) in e-mail reply of Sept 23, 2009 from O. Tarasov).
 69CR4cL Actual half-life is expected to be much longer as suggested by the     
 69CR5cL theoretical value of 14 ms for |b{+-} decay mode (2019Mo01). Other     
 69CR6cL T{-1/2} model predictions: 2016Ma12 (CDFT): 31 ms and                  
 69CR7cL 2020Ne08 (QRPA with Skyrme EDF): 11ms                                  

