 69FE c  2022Po02: {+69}Fe isotopes were produced at TRIUMF's Isotope Separator 
 69FE2c  and Accelerator (ISAC) by impinging 480 MeV protons on a UC{-x} target 
 69FE3c  The reaction products ionized with TRIUMF's resonant laser ion source  
 69FE4c  (TRILIS) using the two-step resonant laser excitation scheme. The      
 69FE3c  ionized beams were mass separated and transported to TRIUMF's Ion Trap 
 69FE4c  for Atomic Nuclear (TITAN) facility where |d-ToF-ms measurements were  
 69FE5c  used to determine masses of the Fe ions based on tof and kinetic       
 69FE6c  energy. Measured mass excess for g.s and isomer and deduced excitation 
 69FE7c  energy for the isomer.                                                 
