 69ZN c  1967Bo39: Measurements were preformed at the 60 inch Argonne cyclotron 
 69ZN2c  with {+3}He beam at 33 MeV impinging a {+70}Zn target. Alpha particles 
 69ZN3c  were detected with solid state detectors. Measured |s(|q) at           
 69ZN4c  |q|?15|'-45|'. Experimental angular distributions were fitted          
 69ZN5c  by DWBA analysis.                                                      
 69ZN c  1973DaXY: The reaction was studied at the E(n)-Tandem van de Graaff    
 69ZN2c  accelerator in Heidelberg. {+3}He with E=17 MeV from the accelerator   
 69ZN3c  bombared a {+70}Zn target. The reaction products were studied using a  
 69ZN4c  magnetic spectrograph with FWHM=15-20 keV. Measured |s(|q),            
 69ZN5c  for |q=5|'-35|'. Experimental angular distributions were fitted        
 69ZN6c  by DWBA analysis.                                                      
