 69GA cL E$From least-squares fit to E|g data by the evaluator, except where    
 69GA2cL noted otherwise                                                        
 69GA cL J$From Adopted Levels, supporting arguments from this reaction         
 69GA2cL are indicated. |g(|q) results are from 1981Pa12                        
