 69GA2c  bombarded |?600 |mg/cm{+2} {+68}Zn foil. Deuterons were detected       
 69GA3c  with Si surface-barrier detectors with FWHM|?120 keV. Measured         
 69GA2c  |s(|q), |q=15|'-80|'. DWBA analysis was performed using the            
 69GA8c  JULIE code.                                                            
