 69GA3c  Gammas were detected at angles 90|', 110|', 124|' and 135|' with       
 69GA4c  respect to the incident beam using Compton Ge(Li)-NaI(Tl) detector     
 69GA5c  system with FWHM=3.5 keV at 1.33 MeV. Measured E|g, I|g and |g(|q).    
 69GA c  1969Ve03: E(n)=0.4-2.5 MeV was produced from the 5.5 MeV Van de Graaff 
 69GA2c  accelerator at the University of Kentucky. Gammas were observed with a 
 69GA3c  shielded Ge(Li) detector in coincidence with the bursts of neutrons    
 69GA4c  from the accelerator. Measured E|g, I|g, |s(E(n)), |g(|q).             
