 69GA2c  accelerator of the Laboratori Nazionali di Legnaro in Padua, Italy.    
 69GA3c  were incident on a thin {+68}Zn target. Scattered protons were detected
 69GA4c  with four Si surface barrier diodes at the angles of 90|', 123|', 140|'
 69GA5c  and 165|' relative to the beam direction with FWHM|?1.5 keV.           
