 69GA  H TYP=FUL$AUT=C.D. NESARAJA$CIT=NDS 207, 1 (2026)$CUT=1-Apr-2023$        
 69GA c  1992Ra05: Vector polarized deuterons with E(d)=52 MeV produced at      
 69GA2c  Karlsruhe isochronous cyclotron were incident on a Ge target.          
 69GA3c  Reaction products were detected with 6 surface barrier detectors       
 69GA4c  with FWHM|?100 keV. Measured |s(|q) and analyzing powers.              
 69GA5c  Performed DWBA calculations to analyze results.                        
 69GA c  1978Ro14: Deuterons at E(d)=26 MeV from the Orsay MP tandem Van de     
 69GA2c  Graaff accelerator bombarded {+70}Ge target. {+3}He particles were     
 69GA3c  detected with 4 solid state position sensitive detectors with          
 69GA4c  FWHM=15 keV. Measured |s(|q) and performed DWBA using the DWUCK code.  
