 69GA2cL {I18} MHz in 2017Fa09 and A(5{Is}{+2}{IS}{-1/2},{+71}Ga)=+1358.2 {I16} 
 69GA3cL MHz (2010Ch16), relative to |m({+71}Ga)=+2.56227 {I2} (2005St24) and   
 69GA4cL J({+71}Ga)=3/2.                                                        
 69GA cL MOME2$ Deduced from the measured B(4{Ip}{+2}{IP}{-3/2},{+69}Ga)=+61    
 69GA2cL {I8} MHz in 2017Fa09 and B(4{Ip}{+2}{IP}{-3/2},{+71}Ga)=+39 {I2} MHz   
 69GA3cL (2010Ch16), relative to Q({+71}Ga)=+0.107 {I1} (2008Py02).             
 69GA cL J$Directly measured using the hyperfine structure analysis in 2017Fa09.
