 69AS    58NI(14N,2PNG)                2009BA30                  26NDS    202601
 69AS  H TYP=FUL$AUT=C.D. NESARAJA$CIT=NDS 207, 1 (2026)$CUT=1-Apr-2023$        
 69AS c  2009Ba30: {+14}N beams at E=37-52 MeV from the FN-tandem Van der       
 69AS2c  Graff accelerator in Bucharest were incident on enriched               
 69AS3c  {+58}Ni targets. Gammas were detected with two HPGe detectors          
 69AS4c  (FWHM=2 keV at 1.33 MeV), and neutrons were detected with a            
 69AS5c  liquid scintillator NE213. Measured E|g, I|g, |g|g coincidence,        
 69AS6c  |g(|q) and linear polarization. All measurements except for            
 69AS7c  |g-linear polarization were performed in coincidence with neutrons     
