 69SE6cL small and rules out the J=3/2 or 5/2 alternatives. This argument       
 69SE7cL establishes J=1/2. There is no experimental evidence for |p, but       
 69SE8cL the shell-model calculations using the GXPF1A interaction states       
 69SE9cL suggest 1/2- (2015Ni01)                                                
